        <item>
            <title>1.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 10:20:27 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>63</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Teleprompter 1.2.0</h3>
<p>Notes mode: show a script as cue cards with tabs, questions, answers and reminders (great for interviews), switch with ⌃⌥1–6 and ⌃⌥↓/↑. A video editor: join recordings, trim, split, change speed, and give the video a background, padding, rounded corners and a 16:9, 9:16 or square shape. Zoom on clicks: hold ⌥ and click while recording to zoom in there. See-through overlay (⌃⌥T): faint and click-through. The overlay can follow your mouse to another monitor.</p>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NM193/teleprompter-releases/main/updates/Teleprompter-1.2.0.zip" length="2514774" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="0Tvf5++qhnbIwhoevuzsv6UsF8+DpxeGtnAPSlMyHO83jNqHu8lJ/u7fnLFkZO9p7+Pv95h9/MyZh15AHqZfDA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:28:35 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>52</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Teleprompter 1.1.0</h3>
<p>Screen recording: record the entire screen, one window or part of the screen, with your microphone, a draggable camera bubble, and a recording bar with pause, start over and discard. A new Recordings window to play, share and manage recordings (⌃⌥R to record). The overlay under the notch can now follow your mouse to another monitor (Settings → Overlay). Screen recording needs macOS 15 or later.</p>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NM193/teleprompter-releases/main/updates/Teleprompter-1.1.0.zip" length="2126166" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="gjvuzRF5uc/Yq4kyC0ooF1+sodT37ej67PnwlDvo/0gWoVq7bKsNjJSraOMcwN5c+p7n4PjSkkGvfl+QFfbTAA=="/>
        </item>
